{
  "$schema": "https://vega.github.io/schema/vega/v6.json",
  "description": "Min–max box plots of published 2024–25 business exit rates in eight Australian states and territories, for three ANZSIC 2006 classes. Every jurisdiction has equal weight; points show all observations. Boxes span linearly interpolated first and third quartiles; the line is the median. Whiskers show minimum and maximum, not Tukey fences. Rates use businesses at the start of the period as their denominator. ABS detailed counts are perturbed; exits do not necessarily mean failures.",
